What this repository contains
-----------------------------
This repository does not contain the engine's configuration. The image it
builds starts FROM the official image bahmni/standard-config (tag 1.0.0 by
default), published by the upstream open-source project under the GNU Affero
General Public License v3 (Copyright (C) 2018 OpenMRS, Inc). Its source is
public at https://github.com/Bahmni/standard-config.

That base image is used as published. Apart from the files listed below,
nothing in it is added, removed or changed.

Files laid over the base image (path inside the image):

  /etc/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/logo.png                    replaced, our artwork
  /etc/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/pioneer-healthcare-logo.png  added, our artwork
  /etc/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/icons/billing.svg           added, our artwork
  /etc/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/icons/clinical.svg          added, our artwork
  /etc/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/icons/laboratory.svg        added, our artwork
  /etc/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/whiteLabel.json             modified upstream file

